# React Product Architecture

A collection of **production-grade React architecture patterns** built with modern tooling and best practices.

This repository serves as a **living reference for scalable frontend architecture patterns used in real-world production systems**.

The goal is to demonstrate **how senior and staff-level frontend engineers design maintainable React applications**, not just build components.

---

# Why This Repository Exists

Most React tutorials focus on **features**.

Real production systems require much more:

- predictable architecture
- reusable patterns
- strong typing
- performance awareness
- accessibility
- testing strategy
- maintainable abstractions

This repository demonstrates **how those concerns are solved in production-grade React applications.**

---

# Tech Stack

Core technologies used throughout the repository:

- React 19
- TypeScript
- Vite
- TailwindCSS
- TanStack Query
- React Hook Form
- Zod
- MSW (Mock Service Worker)
- Vitest
- React Testing Library
- Playwright
- Framer Motion

---

